EvdevTouchParser.java, PressTriggerDetector.java, AccessibilityNodeSnapshot.java, AccessibilityNodeClassifier.java, AccessibilityCandidate.java and AccessibilityCandidateSelector.java are transplanted from references/MMGG, package com.leaf.hyperdragshare.codex, with package changes and attribution headers; EVO removes unused adjacent-paragraph selection and snapshot metadata. EvdevTouchParser additionally retains a pending tracking start until split-frame X/Y coordinates arrive and uses final-frame coordinates on release (covered by EVO regression tests). Reference regression tests are transplanted with package/runtime changes; additional tests are EVO additions.

RootTouchSource, PressCaptureSource, RootNodeCaptureMain, BackgroundTouchBlocker, AccessibilityBlacklist, OverlayTouchRegions, GestureMath and DragShareController inform the adapted EVO implementation. The input transport uses a Shizuku shell getevent PFD stream; node lookup uses EVO accessibility, screenshot and OCR permissions. Text and visible image regions both enter EVO's existing drop panel, intentionally replacing MMGG's default text segmentation. No Root/LSPosed host or click replay is included.
